["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky Eating &amp; Food Guilt with Jennifer Anderson embodied independence hyper-palatable foods PSAE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-raisinggh-挑食焦虑的解药-不评判-不奖励-甜点也是普通食物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9372f4ec9923f201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">46:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>挑食焦虑的解药：不评判，不奖励，甜点也是普通食物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子与食物的关系不取决于吃没吃某样东西，而在家长是否把食物分成好坏、是否用甜点当奖励、是否允许自己按孩子的真实需要喂养；挑食信号越早识别越容易改变。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童喂养</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why straight dating feels bleak heteropessimism hopeful pessimism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-grayarea-异性恋悲观主义-直女困境的真实与表演/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d1e3cbb8f9e58a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>直女约会悲观不是矫情，是政治倒退与经济依附</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sarah Jones 认为，直女对约会男性的尴尬与悲观，既是真实感受也是表演，背后是政治倒退、经济依附与社交媒体强化的复杂现实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">异性恋悲观主义</span><span class=\"tag\">性别政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Historic El Niño Is Coming That Could Cost the World Trillions ENSO Teleconnection RONI Level effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-oddlots-厄尔尼诺不是短期冲击-而是永久性增长损失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>厄尔尼诺不是短期冲击，而是永久性增长损失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">厄尔尼诺不只是短期天气冲击，研究显示它会永久压低经济增长轨迹，一次强厄尔尼诺五年内可造成数万亿美元损失，且我们并未适应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">厄尔尼诺</span><span class=\"tag\">气候经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lindy Teammate: Flo Crivello on Multiplayer Agents, Memory &amp; Why He&#x27;d Ban the Chinese Models He Uses hydration context bucket centary tree TOON hypothesis driven retrieval per-user LoRA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cogrev-lindy-全线跑在-deepseek-上-创始人主张封禁中国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde4d0762bd9b4a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>Lindy 全线跑 DeepSeek，创始人却主张封禁中国模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flo Crivello 说 Lindy 的 agent 现在整条链路的 driver 就是 DeepSeek，而他同时主张全行业一起被禁——因为竞争对手会用，他就不得不用，宁愿协调解决这个囚徒困境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 记忆</span><span class=\"tag\">上下文工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"SK hynix and the HBM Revolution HBM TSV TC-NCF MR-MUF HBM-PIM ADR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-asianometry-sk-hynix-靠-hbm-翻身-客户战略赢过周期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/143ca5977a616036-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>SK hynix 翻身靠的不是 HBM 技术，而是客户关系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SK hynix 的翻身不是押中 HBM 技术，而是押中客户关系与长期投入；Samsung 押注 PIM 边缘推理，恰好把 ChatGPT 时刻的唯一供应商位置让给了对手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Chess.com Teaches US About Superhuman Capabilities, with CEO Erik Allebest Stockfish Leela Chess Zero mittens bot ELO secondary\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-nopriors-ai-让国际象棋变无聊后-又让它更好看了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdff3faf801808d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让国际象棋变无聊后，又让它更好看了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Stockfish 时代棋手模仿完美引擎，比赛变得沉闷；神经网络引擎下出激进非常规的棋，反而把人类棋力推得更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国际象棋</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 与人类技能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chelsea Finn: This is the State of the Art in Robotics compositional generalization subgoal image time-to-success RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-ycsp-机器人单模型开箱追平微调专才-组合泛化已有强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04a76cf95c327656-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">58:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>机器人单模型开箱打平微调专才，组合泛化已有强证据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">机器人单模型开箱追平微调专才，尤其能在从未见过的机械臂上组合泛化，这都依赖用提示词驯服低质异构数据；瓶颈正在转向可靠性、速度和物理分发。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"We Solve the 49ers Viral Conspiracy Theory milligauss deep story\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-sciencevs-变电站不背这口锅-49人队伤病阴谋论被拆穿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>49人队伤病怪变电站？剂量差40倍，数据也不支持</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宣称变电站电磁波导致49人队伤病狂潮的阴谋论，被辐射专家和伤病数据库逐条证伪：剂量远低于安全线、引用的论文不合格、2014年扩建的是另一座电站，数据也显示他们并非最惨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NFL</span><span class=\"tag\">伤病数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transcranial magnetic stimulation and the future of psychiatry | Corey Keller TMS theta burst stimulation cortical excitability limbic subgenual cingulate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-fromourneurons-tms-治抑郁只有五成有效-卡在不懂它怎么改变大脑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>TMS 治抑郁只有五成有效：卡在不懂它怎么改变大脑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TMS 已进入临床却还是「黑箱」，机理不清导致疗效停留在 50%。用癫痫病人颅内电极取到神经元的ground truth，下一步是磨出脑电 biomarker，把治疗从猜参数变成闭环优化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">TMS</span><span class=\"tag\">神经调控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Bernstein: The Money Decisions That Actually Matter | Rational Reminder 422 hedonic treadmill self-determination theory TIPS ladder hyperscalers Easterlin paradox sinning a little\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-rationalreminder-想给孙辈留财富-范德比尔特家族聚会里没有一个百万富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/473a88561804f746-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>想给孙辈留财富？范德比尔特家族聚会里没有一个百万富翁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">财富传承几乎注定失败：继承人每代翻倍稀释、缴税、攀比消费；真正该做的是趁孩子三四十岁用「温暖的手」把钱给出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富传承</span><span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Coffee Sufis Levant Company Lloyd&#x27;s List Robusta Moka pot espresso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-inourtime-咖啡因催生了近代商业情报网络与社交空间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>咖啡不让人醉，反而催生了近代商业情报网络</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">咖啡最早为苏菲派祈祷提供清醒；它不让人醉，反而让人长谈，于是咖啡馆成为商业情报交换所，进而通过奴隶种植园和品牌化重塑全球经济。今天关于拿铁的争论，仍写在这段五百年的历史里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tag\">商业史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: How to Optimize Female Hormone Health for Vitality &amp; Longevity | Dr. Sara Gottfried SHBG CGM PCOS FDG PET HPA axis CAC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-huberman-女性激素真相-睾酮流失与围绝经期脑代谢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1ac1c82ed5e5947-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>女性睾酮每年降1%，围绝经期大脑代谢降20%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女性应在 20 多岁建立激素基线，睾酮每年约降 1%；口服避孕药在降卵巢癌风险的同时可能让阴蒂缩小最多 20%；围绝经期大脑葡萄糖代谢平均降 20%，潮热是疾病信号而非小麻烦。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性激素</span><span class=\"tag\">睾酮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trucking Is Booming Again, And Drivers Aren&#x27;t Happy About It non-domiciled CDL ELD (electronic logging device) freight broker FMCSA safety rating spot vs contract rate owner operator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-oddlots-这轮卡车运价上涨来自供给被砍-不是需求回来了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>卡车运价暴涨不是需求回来了，是供给被执法砍掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英语能力执法、non-domiciled CDL 收紧和最高法院经纪商责任判决同时抽走运力，把三年低谷终结的不是货量回升，而是入行门槛被结构性抬高——下一次需求爆发时市场已无法像 COVID 那样迅速补供给。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">卡车运输</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The blatant betrayal that erased the Tupperware queen from history subversive domesticity burp Wonder Bowl Jubilee\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-throughline-特百惠女王遭公然背叛-被美国历史抹去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6899c998b8f2c10a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>特百惠女王被解雇后，公司埋掉了她的书</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Brownie Wise 用「家庭主妇聚会」把特百惠变成美国国民品牌，却因名气盖过发明家而被解雇、销毁生平记录，直到 2016 年公园命名才被官方承认。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">销售革命</span><span class=\"tag\">女性职场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"LLMs and the economics of Evil, Inc., with Manish Goregaokar BEC money mule AML Regulation E desk name supply chain attack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-complexsys-大模型把骗局工业化-单点登录成了总开关/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/03fbe8332bb0a87a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>大模型把骗局工业化，单点登录成了总开关</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当伪造面试、监控邮箱、合成语音的成本趋近于零，任何人的 SSO 账号都可能被悄无声息接管；银行让谁承担损失，比教会用户识别钓鱼更关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM</span><span class=\"tag\">反诈骗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Romulus &amp; Remus Rex Pomerium Casa Romuli Lupa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-ancients-罗马人清楚建城神话是虚构的-但照样当外交工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9395e3e4c90e300-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>罗马人明知建城神话是假的，却拿它当外交工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马的起源神话不是刻在石头上的信史，而是罗马人用来谈判、整合异族和消化内战的弹性叙事；考古证据甚至与 753 年建城说直接冲突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">神话政治学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"696. Elizabeth I vs The Catholics: Killing the Queen of Scots (Part 6) Bond of Association Act for the Queen&#x27;s Safety presence chamber Star Chamber cipher\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-restishistory-玛丽之死背后的真博弈-伊丽莎白想要暗杀-不想签字/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>伊丽莎白想暗杀玛丽，却被迫签字处决</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊丽莎白一世不想公开处决玛丽，只盼有人按《联合盟约》私下杀她；枢密院坚持法律程序，最终在女王签字后仍违背其意愿，把死刑令连夜送往福瑟林盖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊丽莎白一世</span><span class=\"tag\">玛丽·斯图亚特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"150. 对英伟达研究副总裁刘洺堉的4小时访谈：功夫、Cosmos 3、开源世界模型、黄仁勋、你不需要击败所有对手 Physical AI World Foundation Model Multimodal Transformer Dual-tower\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-zhangxiaojun-英伟达研究副总裁-模型竞争终局是生态-不是击败对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/920e2373c894c74b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达研究副总裁：模型终局是生态，不是击败对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘洺堉：模型能力终将趋同，英伟达做开源世界模型不是竞争而是铺路；物理 AI 的 GPT 时刻未到，但条件正在汇聚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Cosmos</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Noctohabitology (SLEEP PROCRASTINATION) with Vanessa “Nessy” Hill Sleep procrastination Circadian rhythm Cortisol\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-ologies-睡前拖延不是懒-是白天没了自我时间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>睡前拖延不是懒，是白天没了自我时间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多数人睡前拖延只有半小时，真正问题是白天缺自主权；蓝光眼镜效果有限，室内灯光影响更大；自我同情比强迫早睡更能改善睡眠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">睡眠科学</span><span class=\"tag\">行为心理学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Episode 198: Blessing or curse? Dawn grills Ken on listeners’ toughest AI questions in this all-AI AMA confabulation Section 230 DABUS distillation agentic reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-stemtalk-ai-公司不该拿-230-条免责-幻觉也不是等着修的-bug/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5d13d2b13ccdb765-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>AI 公司不该拿 230 条免责，幻觉也不是等着修的 bug</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ken 认为生成式 AI 合成新内容、源头在模型本身，所以更像发布者而非中立平台；而幻觉更接近神经心理学里的 confabulation，是内建于工作方式的风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Stop being skeptical about AI for development with Charity Majors harness conformance testing slop SEV zero doom trolling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-pragmatic-ai-写代码不必逐行读-但信任必须重建/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5f2a55d9c9f0838c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>AI 写代码不必逐行读，但信任必须重建</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2025 的 AI 相当于云的 2010；真正的问题不是是否要读 AI 写的代码，而是何时不读，以及怎样用测试、eval 和 on-call 成本把信任重建回来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 编程</span><span class=\"tag\">代码审查</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The probiotic bacteria engineered to treat diabetes GLP-1 (glucagon-like peptide-1) Molecular brake Proba-3\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-naturepod-活菌当药-让糖尿病治疗随血糖自动开关/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">19:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>糖尿病药随血糖自动开关：活菌按需分泌GLP1</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科学家改造大肠杆菌，使其在高血糖时自动分泌GLP1，在小鼠和猕猴中改善了血糖控制；虽离人体试验尚远，但开启了「按需给药」的活体药物想象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">益生菌</span><span class=\"tag\">糖尿病</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"I wrote an AI textbook — how long until AI can do it better? RLVR RLHF inference-time scaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-interconnects-ai写作停滞-长文非虚构是模型能力的试金石/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba2952184132ad60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">12:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>AI写作停滞：长文非虚构是模型能力的试金石</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型在长文非虚构写作上进步缓慢，暴露了其组织知识能力的缺陷，这比代码和数学的进步更值得警惕，因为它关乎AI能否解决开放科学问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI写作</span><span class=\"tag\">非虚构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Frederick Walton and the Invention of Linoleum linoleum frizzing Camptulicon Lincrusta-Walton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-stuffmissed-油毡之父没注册商标-连名字都成了公共财产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>油毡之父没注册商标，连名字都成了公共财产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Frederick Walton 发明了 linoleum，却因没注册商标而失去名字；真正定义行业标准的技术，来自他手下的员工 C.F. Leak。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">发明史</span><span class=\"tag\">油毡</span>\n</div></div></a>"]